00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.925
-I want to toast
to your new book.

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:56.629
And I figured why not toast with
actually your own bourbon.

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.097
-Oh, man.

00:04:58.097 --> 00:05:00.233
Guys, I have my own bourbon.

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:02.168
It's called Brown Sugar Bourbon.

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.237
Listen, I'mma tell you
